inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The death this daemon deals is the lingering one, and the line has to","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"say so."}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" The first dark turn only warns, and the dice wait for dark turn"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"graceTurns + 2","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — the third dark turn at the default grace of one, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"never earlier than dark turn 2, because dark turn 1 is the warning’s own","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"arm however low ","type":"text"},{"code":"graceTurns","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" goes. So a","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"death here lands on a turn spent lingering in a dark the player has"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"already been warned about, rather than on the turn the dark began —"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"whether that later turn is a move or a wait."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Zork has two death sentences, and both belong to moves. "},{"code":"V-WALK","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"code":"gverbs.zil:1578","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":") says “You have walked into the slavering fangs of a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"lurking grue!” and fires only on a "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"blocked"}]},{"type":"text","text":" move in the dark, a mechanic"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"this plugin does not have at all; "},{"code":"GOTO","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" ("},{"code":"gverbs.zil:2110-2114","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":") says"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"“A lurking grue slithered into “ and then the vehicle’s name, or the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"word “room”, “and devoured you!” — the grue comes to the player, so it is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the one that fits. Both games here had been handed the first. (#350)"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"That branch is why "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoDangerousDark\/documentation\/GnustoDangerousDark\/DangerousDark\/Text\/death","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" takes a subject: the vehicle the player was","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"aboard, or nothing. Both halves are the game’s own words. A library that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"has never seen the game has no business deciding what to call the place","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"somebody was taken from, so the stock line names none.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The grue daemon: each dark turn ticks the counter. The warning prints on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the first dark turn; dark turns 2…"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"graceTurns + 1"},{"type":"text","text":" are a silent grace;"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"from dark turn "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"graceTurns + 2"},{"type":"text","text":" on, each turn rolls "},{"code":"chance(lethality)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"to be eaten. Stepping back into the light — or ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoDangerousDark\/documentation\/GnustoDangerousDark\/DangerousDark\/suspended","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" — resets the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"count. Guards before the draw, so a lit turn burns no randomness.","type":"text"}],"references":{"doc://GnustoDangerousDark/documentation/GnustoDangerousDark/DangerousDark/suspended":{"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/gnustodangerousdark\/dangerousdark\/suspended","identif